# Field: title

**Definition:** A concise, descriptive title that uniquely identifies the document.

**Rules:**
- Do NOT include the correspondent in the title (no abbreviations or variations either).
- Include the most likely document type (e.g., Invoice, Contract, Statement, Notice).
- If money is involved, include the amount in the title if possible.
- For invoices, describe what was purchased or which service was provided.
- Do not simply copy the first sentence of the document — be as descriptive as possible.
- Fallback: "No Title Found" — only if no title can be derived at all.

{{.TitleExplanation}}

